>[Warning, the damage increase may not be correct]
>                                   Damage
>  Name           Weapon type        S  L   Special                       Align
>------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>| Cleaver      | Axe              | 3 12 |                               | C |
etc
I think the warning is correct: the damage increase is not correct.
When hitting a monster there are 2 variables importent: the change to actualy
hit a monster (hitval) and the damage done by the hit (dmgval). The first
number in the list is the value added to the hitvalue of the weapon, the second
is the value added to the damage value of the weapon. So, an Axe named Cleaver
has a +3 hitvalue over a normal axe and above that the hit damage is +12.
The Small and Large damage is for the weapons only.


